00:19:37.430 --> 00:19:40.210
They don't want to give you any control,

00:19:40.210 --> 00:19:42.020
they want all the control.

00:19:42.020 --> 00:19:46.760
So anything that has to do
with you and your own control,

00:19:46.760 --> 00:19:49.460
being the captain of your own
ship, they never talk about,

00:19:49.460 --> 00:19:52.280
and they don't wanna relinquish
a second of it to you.

00:19:52.280 --> 00:19:55.130
