00:20:28.890 --> 00:20:32.140
There's hundreds of private hospitals

00:20:32.140 --> 00:20:34.270
and those aren't filled to capacity.

00:20:34.270 --> 00:20:36.250
So they leave that part out.

00:20:36.250 --> 00:20:40.640
So essentially saying
county USC is filled,

00:20:40.640 --> 00:20:44.690
but not St Joseph's up the
street or Cedars down the street.

00:20:44.690 --> 00:20:47.050
So be careful when you hear them talk

00:20:47.050 --> 00:20:49.350
about who's bursting at the scene.

00:20:49.350 --> 00:20:50.260
- Well, I don't want to lead you.

